  unitName: Executioner Shida
  unitId: 60094
  unitNumber: 331
  description: A supervisor of all magicians in the ruined Bariura Empire. As his
    empire faced collapse from the gods' attack, he decided to present the findings
    of his research. He was now able to sublimate living beings, and though their
    bodies were destroyed in the process, as his servants their spirits were ferociously
    powerful. It's rumored that his research produced more additional findings, though
    none are recorded in any known documents.
  summonDesc: A Summoner, I see.<br>That's fine with me.<br>I can use you in my research.
  fusionDesc: The dead are my guinea pigs.<br>My research can continue.<br>Mwa ha
    ha ha...
  evoDesc: Would you like to see the <br>findings of my research?<br>I warn you,
    they're frightening...
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
